# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Fixed life payment or discard as an alternate additional cost.
# Forcing: Both payments are available, with one target and a second creature as a targeting control.
# AI behavior: Empty opposing hand leaves targeting and resolution uncontested.
# Protocol path: Cast, ChooseOrCost, targeting, life payment or discard, and resolution.
# Failure modes: Missing labels, wrong payment, incorrect target, or stalled continuation.
# Card roles: Island retains a legal post-resolution land action so automatic passing cannot advance the fixture. Bitter Triumph opens the choice; Grizzly Bears pays discard; Swamps pay mana; Centaur Courser is the target; Ornithopter is the control.
